# Atlas Core Dashboard Density Simplification Spec
**Author:** Prism Adeyemi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 20:15  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Design specification and token reduction plan for simplifying the Atlas Core dashboard layout, cutting rendering overhead and visual clutter by consolidating widgets based on requirements in Company Document.

